ory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, February to March and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 22% of normal in November to December and 29% in March to April. Grid 7996 had its driest year in 1981 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
